@page
@model Project_R_._8.Pages.cshtml.TutorialModel
@{
	ViewData["Title"] = "Tutorial";
}

<h1><u>How To Play</u></h1>
<ul class="controlsList">
	<lt><u>Controls:</u></lt>
	<li>W - Accelerate</li>
	<li>S - Break</li>
	<li>SpaceBar - Clutch Pedal</li>
	<li>NumPad1-6 - Pick Gears 1-6</li>
</ul>
<p>
	To switch between gears you need to hit the clutch and pick the gear that you want to switch to at the same time.<br>
	Note: you can only switch gears on rpm at the green zone or higher<br>
	6th gear cannot reach an rpm of more then 7k while the other gears can reach over that and go up to 8k<br>
	If you want to reach the most amount of speed you want to switch to the highest gear possible.<br>
</p>